OL,3,GNEWSAParents fined for employing teen
OL,4,Ason in food trailer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a 14-year-old boy have
OL,7,Fbeen fined for allowing him to work on
OL,8,Fthe family's mobile food trailer.
OL,10,FKaren and Greg Olejarka pleaded guilty
OL,11,Fat Southampton Magistrates' Court to
OL,12,Fbreaching Hampshire County Council's
OL,13,Fbyelaws prohibiting under-16s from
OL,14,Fworking in commercial kitchens.
OL,16,FThe Hampshire couple have been fined
OL,17,F#600 and ordered to pay a further
OL,18,F#6,000 in costs.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
