OL,3,GNEWSAParents fined for employing teen
OL,4,Ason in food trailer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family had argued they were simply
OL,7,Fsupporting their son's passion for
OL,8,Fcooking by allowing him to prepare food
OL,9,Fin the trailer from the age of 12.
